        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic two-bedroom, one bathroom Semi Detached property to the market in the mature and well-established Springbank development, Saggart, Dublin 24.\r\nThis excellent home offers a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike, with spacious accommodation of c. 75 sqm and the added benefit of a large garage to the side, providing excellent additional storage and potential for a variety of uses.\r\nThe location is next to none, with Saggart Village and Rathcoole Village both within easy reach, offering a wide array of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, leisure facilities and the picturesque Rathcoole Park. Citywest Shopping Centre is also close by, providing an extensive selection of shops, restaurants and everyday conveniences.\r\nFor commuters, the property benefits from excellent transport links, with numerous bus routes serving the surrounding area, the Red Line Luas within easy reach and convenient access to both the N7 and M50 motorway networks.\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property also benefits from gas fired central heating and the substantial side garage is a particularly attractive feature.\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>c. 75 sqm</li>\r\n <li>2 bed / 1 bath</li>\r\n <li>Semi Detached</li>\r\n <li>Large garage to the side</li>\r\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\r\n <li>Mature and well-established development</li>\r\n <li>Excellent location</li>\r\n <li>Close to Saggart & Rathcoole Villages</li>\r\n <li>Citywest Shopping Centre nearby</li>\r\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\r\n <li>Easy access to N7 & M50</li>\r\n <li>Red Line Luas within easy reach</li>\r\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nViewing is highly advised to appreciate the potential this property has to offer.\r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 01 908 9300 for further information or to arrange a viewing."
      },
